{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsfoundations\/oudswcag21ratio\/requirementsaaa"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/OUDSWCAG21Ratio\/requirementsAAA","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations","doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/OUDSWCAG21Ratio"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"text":"WCAG 2.1 requirement for AAA level needs to have textual component matching 7:1 contrast ratio","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and non textual component matching 4.5:1 contrast ratio.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This is recommended for mobiles devices projects (because of screen sizes and luminosity issues).","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"requirementsAAA"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/WCAG21Requirements","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"WCAG21Requirements","preciseIdentifier":"s:15OUDSFoundations18WCAG21Requirementsa"},{"kind":"text","text":" { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}]}]}],"metadata":{"title":"requirementsAAA","modules":[{"name":"Foundations"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","symbolKind":"property","externalID":"s:15OUDSFoundations15OUDSWCAG21RatioV15requirementsAAASb7textual_Sb10nonTextualtvp","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"requirementsAAA"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"WCAG21Requirements","preciseIdentifier":"s:15OUDSFoundations18WCAG21Requirementsa"}]},"references":{"doc://OUDSFoundations/documentation/OUDSFoundations/OUDSWCAG21Ratio":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSWCAG21Ratio","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"OUDSWCAG21Ratio","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/OUDSWCAG21Ratio","url":"\/documentation\/oudsfoundations\/oudswcag21ratio","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Some countries set up new laws so as to force companies to have a better accessibility of their digital services.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"This is for example the case for France with the "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"also named “RGAA”.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"The WCAG specifications, for AA level, defines a contrast ratio of 4.5:1 for textual elements (i.e. texts), and 3:1 for non-textual elements (i.e. link’s chevron)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However it is higly recommended for mobile devices to reach AAA level because of the screen sizes and luminosity issues, i.e. 7:1 for textual"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and 4.5:1 for non-textual elements."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This utility helps to define whether a set of contrast ratio matches AA and AAA or not."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"See for example "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/system.design.orange.com\/0c1af118d\/p\/2531b9-accessibility-compliance","isActive":true}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSWCAG21Ratio","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://OUDSFoundations/documentation/OUDSFoundations":{"title":"Foundations","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_layers.png"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oudsfoundations","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUD